  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile investigation): the May-30 backfill on this item names the sketch-perf cluster correctly. L8 review confirms a fourth co-member is INV-dadaf-zozih-janid-kupag-zukag-balun-tapab-jivog. Candidate sub-META framing for all four (this item + INV-jumim + WI-zipoj + INV-dadaf): \"sketch read-path does redundant computation when authoritative data is already on bm.json or disk\" — the centrality/embedding recompute on warm cache here, the test-file rglob in INV-jumim, the >1M LOC slowness in WI-zipoj, and the artifact-emission in INV-dadaf are four faces of one anti-pattern."  # 719e
